n&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;opportunity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;Hyperlink SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; href=&quot;http://wpp.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Underlined SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to shape the future of tech? Axicom wants YOU!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Forget boring press releases. At Axicom, we&#39;re not just telling stories, we&#39;re &lt;strong&gt;seeing, shaping and sharing the future&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for the world&#39;s most innovative tech brands across the digital ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re an &lt;strong&gt;award-winning team&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(Provoke&#39;s Best Agency to Work for EMEA Network 2024, Tech Agency of the Year shortlist 2024, Provoke’s Most Disruptive Agency of the Year 2025) and we&#39;re on the hunt for a passionate, digital-savvy Account Executive to join our ranks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re buzzing with enthusiasm for tech live on social media, and thrive in a place where &lt;strong&gt;Futurists not Followers&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;isn&#39;t just a motto (it’s how we live and breathe), then keep reading!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Axicom is your next big move:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re the ONLY global tech specialist comms agency within WPP.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;That means you get the culture and agility of a boutique agency with the powerhouse resources of the world&#39;s largest marketing services company. Best of both worlds? Absolutely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We have brilliant clients:&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;From the largest global businesses like Meta, AMD, Cisco, Honor, Dropbox, and Activision, to innovative new brands shaking up the industry such as XTool and Hypershell. You’ll have the opportunity to work on integrated digital programmes and social campaigns across a fantastic portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are story-first, channel-smart&lt;/strong&gt;: We believe story is everything, and you’ll help us tell it where it matters most. Working alongside our creative strategists, PR pros, influencer specialists, and paid media experts, you’ll help deliver campaigns where the idea leads and the channels follow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are the most tech-enabled communications group worldwide: &lt;/strong&gt;We don&#39;t just talk tech; we use it. By uniting the creativity of our people with the power of AI, we&#39;re opening a world of new opportunities. You will have access to proprietary AI platforms and cutting-edge social tools to power your day-to-day work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Intelligent working is our vibe:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Forget rigid rules. Our industry leading flexible framework gives you the freedom and balance you need to thrive. Based around core hours, we trust you to deliver and we support you in balancing your workday in a way that suits you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our culture rocks:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We delight in differences, prize peculiarity and find fun in the most unexpected places. We&#39;re brave, bold and always pushing for more -ourselves, one another and our clients. We win together, celebrate every success and always have each other&#39;s backs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission: The Digital Native&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Digital Account Executive, you&#39;re not just supporting; you&#39;re diving headfirst into the action. We need someone who understands how to make tech brands explode online.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Social Strategist: &lt;/strong&gt;You know your TikTok from your LinkedIn. You’ll help manage communities, identify engagement opportunities, and spot the latest trends before they go mainstream.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Creator: &lt;/strong&gt;You aren&#39;t just posting; you’re helping create. Whether it’s drafting killer social copy, briefing creative assets, or helping shape a digital campaign narrative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Paid Amplifier: &lt;/strong&gt;You know that organic reach is only half the battle. You will support the activation of paid social campaigns (primarily LinkedIn and Meta), assisting with audience building, ad set-up, and budget monitoring to ensure our content hits the right targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Connector: &lt;/strong&gt;You will help identify and manage relationships with key influencers and creators—from macro-tech voices to micro-niche experts—ensuring our brands are part of the right conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Integrated Pro: &lt;/strong&gt;We don&#39;t do silos. You will work hand-in-glove with our PR teams to ensure our digital strategies amplify media moments and vice versa. You&#39;ll help translate headlines into hashtags, ensuring a seamless narrative across all channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Analyst: &lt;/strong&gt;You understand that data tells a story. You’ll help track performance, analyze social metrics, and prove the ROI of our work to clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for candidates with specific&amp;nbsp;Digital / Social Media expertise&amp;nbsp;who embody our three core values:&amp;nbsp;Intelligence, Initiative, and Integrity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Intelligent: &lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re curious, switched-on, and love to learn. You&#39;re naturally creative in finding solutions and fearlessly share your thoughts on new platforms and tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Initiative: &lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re proactive, eager to take ownership, and always looking for ways to make things better. You don&#39;t wait to be told; you do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrity: &lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re honest, credible, and build trust through inclusive behaviour. You&#39;re committed to making a positive impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essentials &amp;amp; Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a digital, social, or integrated agency role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of core social platforms (LinkedIn, X, Instagram, TikTok) in a B2B or B2C context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with social copywriting and content calendars.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of paid social platforms (LinkedIn Campaign Manager / Meta Ads Manager).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in influencer outreach or management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basics of digital analytics and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer (beyond the usual perks):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exciting career growth:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We&#39;re invested in your journey, with clear paths for development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generous remuneration &amp;amp; benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Because you&#39;re worth it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; development:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Access to Employee Assistance, LinkedIn Learning and bespoke training to keep you at the top of your game.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Culture of support:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll be part of a team that truly values diversity, celebrates individuality and believes in winning together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to be a Futurist?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re ready to join a team that&#39;s passionate about tech, obsessed with innovation and committed to making a real impact, then &lt;strong&gt;apply now!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-BC1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You belong at Axicom:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is for Axicom, a Burson Group company, to be the leading ‘academy company’ for creative communications professionals and emerging leaders. We provide a dynamic environment where ambitious colleagues come to elevate their skills, expand their networks, and ultimately, produce the best solutions for today’s leading brands. Our commitment to your growth is reflected in our robust benefits and people programs, which include professional development opportunities, mentorship programs with industry leaders, a vibrant and inclusive company culture fostering collaboration and innovation and packages designed to reward and retain top talent. We invest in our people because we believe their success is our success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Axicom, we’re an agency of learn-it-alls. We recognize that the things we do best, creativity and communications, require a level of nuanced understanding. That’s why it’s imperative for us to hire extraordinarily talented people of all backgrounds and identities. Without that we can’t do the essential work of inspiring bold ideas, fostering constructive dialogue, cultivating meaningful experiences, and driving innovation and creativity for our partners. Your unique point of view—your talent—is what makes you a #BursonPerson, and it’s how we deliver exceptional results for our clients, together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button below, this will send any information you add below to Burson. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy. &lt;/a&gt;California residents should read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice. &lt;/a&gt;This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Hudson River Trading (HRT) is seeking a Research Data Expert to join our Data team. Data is a cornerstone of HRT’s trading strategies, serving as the raw fuel that powers research, automated trading, and risk management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will own a specific area of expertise, working on sourcing junior data engineers, platform engineers, and alpha researchers to build and maintain trading strategies. You will also be responsible for providing fully featurized datasets to statistical modeling researchers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HRT does not have information siloes. You will be collaborating directly with our researchers and will be responsible for driving&amp;nbsp; the business forward through rigorous data analysis and delivery. You will also manage the full end-to-end pipeline from vendor downloads to trading-ready data. As an expert in one area, you will mentor junior data engineers, assisting and validating their work, and will partner with our sourcing team to identify optimal opportunities for data procurement. Furthermore, you will be responsible for ensuring high-quality service by implementing rigorous data checks and alerts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain fully featurized datasets for statistical modeling research&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the subject matter expert for a designated data domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical support and guidance to researchers on vendor data and derived datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and direct junior data engineers, including performing code and data output validation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the sourcing team to identify and evaluate new data procurement opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze data to identify and improve alpha&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the full end-to-end data pipeline, from raw vendor ingestion to refined feature sets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide on-call support for data issues during normal business hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement automated data quality checks and monitoring alerts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills (Python/R preferred) and proficiency in data science methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience in a specific data domain (e.g., alternative data, fundamentals, security reference, or economic data)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of building alpha through detailed data analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undergraduate degree in a STEM field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The estimated base salary range for this position is 200,000 to 300,000 USD per year (or local equivalent). The base pay offered may vary depending on multiple individualized factors, including location, job-related knowledge, skills, and experience. This role will also be eligible for discretionary performance-based bonuses and a competitive benefits package.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-value=&quot;{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Hudson River Trading (HRT) brings a scientific approach to trading financial products. We have built one of the world&#39;s most sophisticated computing environments for research and development. Our researchers are at the forefront of innovation in the world of algorithmic trading. \n\nAt HRT we come from a variety of disciplines: mathematics and computer science, physics, and engineering, media and tech. We’re a community of self-starters who are motivated by the excitement of being at the cutting edge of automation in every part of our organization - from trading, to business operations, to recruiting and beyond.  Our culture celebrates great ideas whether they come from HRT veterans or new hires.  At HRT we’re friends and colleagues – whether we are sharing a meal, playing the latest board game, or writing elegant code. We embrace a culture of togetherness that extends far beyond the walls of our office.\n\nFeel like you belong at HRT? Our goal is to find the best people and bring them together to do great work in a place where everyone is valued. HRT is proud of our diverse staff; we have offices all over the globe and benefit from our varied and unique perspectives. HRT is an equal opportunity employer; so whoever you are we’d love to get to know you.&amp;quot;}&quot; data-sheets-userformat=&quot;{&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:13185,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0},&amp;quot;10&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;11&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;12&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;15&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;IBM Plex Sans&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;16&amp;quot;:11}&quot; data-sheets-textstyleruns=&quot;{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0}{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:328,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:16711935}}}{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:402}{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:917,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:16711935}}}{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:945}&quot;&gt;Hudson River Trading (HRT) brings a scientific approach to trading financial products. We have built one of the world&#39;s most sophisticated computing environments for research and development. Our researchers are at the forefront of innovation in the world of algorithmic trading. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At HRT we welcome a variety of expertise: mathematics and computer science, physics and engineering, media and tech. We’re a community of self-starters who are motivated by the excitement of being at the cutting edge of automation in every part of our organization—from trading, to business operations, to recruiting and beyond. We value openness and transparency, and celebrate great ideas from HRT veterans and new hires alike. At HRT we’re friends and colleagues – whether we are sharing a meal, playing the latest board game, or writing elegant code. We embrace a culture of togetherness that extends far beyond the walls of our office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Feel like you belong at HRT? Our goal is to find the best people and bring them together to do great work in a place where everyone is valued. HRT is proud of our diverse staff; we have offices all over the globe and benefit from our varied and unique perspectives. HRT is an equal opportunity employer; so whoever you are we’d love to get to know you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
